 after childbirth: women's experiences, persistent morbidity and lack of professional recognition</article-title><source>Br J Obstet Gynaecol</source><year>1997</year><volume>104</volume><fpage>330</fpage><lpage>335</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9091011</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>